SOFTWARE TESTING REPORT

Inventory Management System | Laravel 11 + Filament



1. Project Information



Project Title: Inventory Management System

Tech Stack: Laravel 11, Filament Admin Panel, Livewire, Tailwind CSS, MySQL

Course / Subject: Software Testing

Group 4: Chem Indraboth, Nat Sinoeun, Khun Kimheng, Thy Sovannmakara, Nhun Pisal

Instructor: Mr. Heng Chanarin

Date: May 30, 2026



2. System Overview



This project is a fully-featured Inventory Management System built with Laravel 11 and the Filament admin panel framework. It provides a responsive, modern UI backed by Laravel's Eloquent ORM and secure authentication system.

Purpose: Manage products, categories, stock in/out transactions, and user authentication for inventory control, Role and Permission

Target Users: Business admins, inventory managers, warehouse staff



Main Features

Product management (create, read, update, delete)

Category management with product associations

Supplier management 

Loan inventory management 

Stock In / Stock Out transaction recording

Dashboard with inventory overview

Admin login and role/permission 



3. Testing Objectives



Validate all CRUD operations for Products, Categories, and Stock transactions

Detect bugs and logical errors in inventory and stock management modules

Verify authentication and authorization controls

Ensure data validation is enforced on all input fields

Confirm stock integrity (no negative quantities)









4. Testing Scope



In Scope

Authentication module (login, logout, route protection)

Products module (CRUD, validation, search/filter)

Categories module (CRUD, referential integrity)

Out of Scope

Database migration performance under high load

Third-party package internals (Filament, Livewire core)

Email/notification integrations



5. Testing Strategy / Approach



Testing Types: Unit Testing, Feature/Integration Testing

Methods: Black-box testing for UI flows; White-box testing for Laravel model/controller logic

Framework: PHPUnit (built into Laravel via phpunit.xml)

Manual Testing: Filament admin panel tested manually in browser



6. Test Environment



Hardware: Laptop (Ryzen 9, 16 GB RAM)

Operating System: Windows 11

PHP Version: PHP 8.2+

Framework: Laravel 11

Database: MySQL 8.0 

Browser: Chrome

Testing Tools: PHPUnit, Artisan test runner (php artisan test)



