8. Defect Report

Defect ID

Description

Severity

Steps to Reproduce

Status

D01

User role assignment originally failed when the 'teacher' role did not exist before assignRole(). The test now creates the role first.

High

1. Run UserModel test  2. test_user_can_have_roles creates role 'teacher'  3. User::create() succeeds  4. assignRole('teacher') succeeds  5. hasRole('teacher') returns true

Fixed

D02

Multiple role assignment originally failed when required roles did not exist before assignRole(). The test now creates both roles first.

High

1. Run UserModel test  2. test_user_can_have_multiple_roles creates roles 'teacher' and 'user'  3. User::create() succeeds  4. assignRole() succeeds for both roles  5. hasRole() returns true for both

Fixed



